OL,3,GNEWSA'Terrifying' 101-acre data centre
OL,4,Aplans would be 'heartbreaking',
OL,5,Acampaigners warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FA proposed data centre spanning 101
OL,8,Facres in Gwynedd would have a
OL,9,F"heartbreaking" effect on the landscape
OL,10,Fand wildlife, campaigners have warned.
OL,12,FDevelopers want to build the new centre
OL,13,Fbetween Caernarfon and Y Felinheli,
OL,14,Fsaying it could create more than 900
OL,15,Fjobs during construction and a further
OL,16,F200 permanent roles.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
