OL,3,GNEWSA'Terrifying' 101-acre data centre
OL,4,Aplans would be 'heartbreaking',
OL,5,Acampaigners warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut nearly 15,000 people signed a
OL,8,Fpetition in opposition to the plans,
OL,9,Fwith local campaigners saying the
OL,10,Fproposed development is too big and
OL,11,Fwould lead to noise pollution and ruin
OL,12,Fthe landscape.
OL,14,FA spokesperson for Canolfan Ddata Menai
OL,15,Fsaid it would "transform and revitalise
OL,16,Fthe long-derelict" site and offer
OL,17,Fsignificant employment, with plans
OL,18,Fcurrently out for public consultation.
